# Test: RADIUS admin authentication succeeds over SSH with profile mapping
# VALIDATES: Access-Accept authenticates through RADIUS and Filter-Id maps admin authorization.
# PREVENTS: the RADIUS admin backend being registered but never reached by the chain.
#
# RFC requirement: RFC3579-3-2 positive -- "The NAS-Port or NAS-Port-Id
# attributes SHOULD be included by the NAS in Access-Request packets": the
# RADIUS server logs NAS-Port-Id `ssh` on the Access-Request of an SSH login.

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=le test fixture plugin/aaa-radius-admin:timeout=20s
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stderr:pattern=OK: RADIUS server read NAS-Port-Id ssh
expect=stderr:pattern=auth success.*source=radius
